# Local
.DS_Store
*.local
*.log*

# Env — only .env.example is committed
.env
!.env.example

# Working documents: hand-offs between the frontend and the backend. Written to
# be read once, not maintained as part of the codebase.
*PROMPT*.md

# Dist
node_modules
dist/

# Profile
.rspack-profile-*/

# Índices derivados del código: se regeneran, y versionarlos genera conflictos
